  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;are the roots of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><msqrt><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>5</mn></msqrt></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><msqrt><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></msqrt></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;then the equation, whose roots are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac></math>,",
